# "{5}, {T}, Exile The Echoverse Fulcrum: Destroy all creatures." The costs of an activated ability are paid together
# (CR 602.2b, 601.2h), so the {T} is paid on the Fulcrum while it is still a permanent: it becomes tapped on the
# battlefield (CR 701.26a) and is exiled tapped, and its last-known information says so (CR 608.2h). A tap recorded after
# it had gone to exile would be a tap of a card that is no longer a permanent. `LeftBattlefield` reads the history in order:
# the Fulcrum leaves first, as the cost, tapped; the two Ornithopters (Bot1's own and Bot2's), destroyed as the ability
# resolves, leave untapped. The five Moxen that paid the {5} were tapped but never left.

